<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-HERTHA BERLIN SIGN ROY FROM FOREST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-HERTHA BERLIN SIGN ROY FROM FOREST.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Hertha Berlin said on Friday they had signed Dutch forward Bryan Roy from English club Nottingham Forest.</p>
<p>The Bundesliga newcomers said Roy was expected to arrive in Berlin to start pre-season training on Monday. The club did not disclose the transfer fee for the 27-year-old player.</p>
</text>
